  read: [
    {"type": "p7", "kind": "ad", "title": "Job Opening: Customer Service Representative", "text": "Brightline Telecom is looking for a full-time customer service representative to join our team in Taichung.\nResponsibilities: answering customer calls and emails, solving account problems, and keeping records.\nRequirements: at least one year of customer service experience, good English and Chinese skills, and basic computer skills.\nWe offer a competitive salary, health insurance, and 15 days of paid vacation.\nTo apply, send your résumé and a cover letter to jobs@brightline.com by June 20. Only shortlisted candidates will be contacted.", "qs": [["What is NOT a requirement for the job?", ["Customer service experience", "Language skills", "A university degree", "Computer skills"], 2, "條件裡有經驗、語言和電腦能力，但沒有要求大學學歷。"], ["What benefit is mentioned?", ["Free meals", "Paid vacation", "A company car", "Flexible hours"], 1, "15 days of paid vacation。"], ["Who will be contacted?", ["All applicants", "Only shortlisted candidates", "Current employees", "Customers"], 1, "Only shortlisted candidates will be contacted。"]], "zh": "職缺：客服專員\n明線電信正在徵求一名全職客服專員，加入我們在台中的團隊。\n工作內容：接聽客戶電話和回覆電子郵件、處理帳戶問題，以及保存紀錄。\n條件：至少一年的客服經驗、良好的英文和中文能力，以及基本的電腦技能。\n我們提供具競爭力的薪資、健康保險和 15 天的帶薪休假。\n應徵者請在 6 月 20 日前把履歷和求職信寄到 jobs@brightline.com。只有入圍的應徵者會接到通知。"}
  ],
