  read: [
    {"type": "p7", "kind": "article", "title": "Local Café Goes Viral", "text": "A small café in Tainan has become famous after a video about it was shared on social media. The video, which shows the owner making colorful pineapple cakes, was viewed more than three million times in one week.\nSince the video was posted, the café has been visited by tourists from all over Taiwan. On weekends, customers often wait in line for over an hour.\nThe owner, Ms. Hsu, says she did not pay for any advertising. \"A customer filmed the video. I didn't even know about it,\" she said. Ms. Hsu now plans to open a second shop next year.", "qs": [["Why has the café become famous?", ["It won an award", "A video about it was shared online", "It was on a TV show", "It has very low prices"], 1, "after a video about it was shared on social media。"], ["What is suggested about Ms. Hsu?", ["She paid for an ad campaign", "She made the video herself", "She did not expect the video", "She plans to close the café"], 2, "影片是顧客拍的，她說 I didn't even know about it，可見她沒預料到。"], ["What does Ms. Hsu plan to do?", ["Open another shop", "Hire a video team", "Raise her prices", "Sell cakes online"], 0, "plans to open a second shop next year。"]], "zh": "在地咖啡館爆紅\n台南一家小咖啡館在一支關於它的影片被分享到社群媒體後爆紅。這支影片拍的是老闆製作彩色鳳梨酥的過程，一週內被觀看超過三百萬次。\n自從影片發布以來，來自全台各地的觀光客紛紛造訪這家咖啡館。週末時，顧客經常要排隊超過一小時。\n老闆許女士說她沒有花錢打任何廣告。她說：「影片是一位顧客拍的，我甚至不知道這件事。」許女士現在計畫明年開第二家店。"}
  ],
