    {"type": "p7", "kind": "memo", "title": "New safety rules", "text": "To: All factory staff\nFrom: Michael Tan, Plant Manager\nSubject: New safety rules\nStarting Monday, May 6, the following rules will apply in all production areas:\n1. Protective glasses and helmets must be worn at all times.\n2. Machines must be turned off completely before cleaning.\n3. Any injury, even a small one, must be reported to a supervisor immediately.\nThese rules were introduced after an inspection last month. A short training session will be held in the cafeteria on Friday at 3 p.m. Attendance is required for all staff.", "qs": [["What is the purpose of the memo?", ["To announce new safety rules", "To introduce a new manager", "To report an injury", "To change working hours"], 0, "主旨就是 New safety rules，內容列出新規定。"], ["What must workers do before cleaning a machine?", ["Wear gloves", "Call a supervisor", "Turn the machine off", "Fill out a form"], 2, "Machines must be turned off completely before cleaning。"], ["Why were the rules introduced?", ["Because of a new law", "Because of a recent inspection", "Because of customer complaints", "Because a machine was replaced"], 1, "introduced after an inspection last month。"], ["What will happen on Friday?", ["An inspection", "A training session", "A factory tour", "A staff party"], 1, "A short training session will be held… on Friday。"]], "zh": "收件人：全體工廠員工\n寄件人：廠長 陳麥可\n主旨：新的安全規定\n從 5 月 6 日星期一開始，所有生產區域將實施以下規定：\n1. 任何時候都必須配戴護目鏡和安全帽。\n2. 清潔機器前必須完全關機。\n3. 任何受傷，即使是小傷，都必須立刻向主管回報。\n這些規定是在上個月的一次檢查後制定的。星期五下午 3 點將在員工餐廳舉辦一場簡短的訓練課程，全體員工都必須出席。"}
